Out of Cash: controls
=====================

The game is played with the mouse, as a classic point and click
adventure (it is in Spanish). From the author's Manual.txt:

  Left button    in the room: do the chosen verb on what the pointer is
                 over, or skip a line someone is saying
                 in a conversation: pick a line
                 on the verbs: choose a verb
                 on the inventory arrows: page up and down
                 on the inventory: do the verb on that object
  Right button   in the room: the object's own verb, or back to GO TO
                 on the verbs: back to GO TO
                 on the inventory arrows: first or last page
                 on the inventory: that object's own verb
  Double click   with GO TO, walk faster
  Esc            the menu: save, load, options, restart, quit
  Space          pause

The verbs from the keyboard:
  Q GO TO (IR)        W LOOK (MIRAR)     E OPEN (ABRIR)
  A PICK UP (COGER)   S USE (USAR)       D CLOSE (CERRAR)
  Z MOVE (MOVER)      X GIVE (DAR)       C TALK (HABLAR)
